my-bnm-rmit-oscal
=================

This repository publishes OSCAL 1.1.2 conversion artifacts derived from
Bank Negara Malaysia's "Risk Management in Technology (RMiT)" policy
document (issued 25 September 2026).

Source document
---------------

Title:         Risk Management in Technology (RMiT)
Publisher:     Bank Negara Malaysia
Policy ref:    BNM/RH/PD 028-98
Issued:        25 September 2026
Effective:     28 November 2025 (except where otherwise stated)
URL:           https://www.bnm.gov.my/documents/20124/938039/pd-rmit-sep26.pdf

The source content remains © Bank Negara Malaysia. The upstream PDF is the
authoritative text; the OSCAL rendering in this repository is unofficial.

The source PDF itself is NOT redistributed from this repository. The
`rlinks` in `catalog.json` point to the canonical URL above, and the PDF's
SHA256 is recorded in `provenance.json` so that downstream consumers can
reproduce the exact build.

